[{"answer":"Okay Mary, I know I'm putting on weight with all my bad eating habits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/1.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right. Chocolate bars, pizzas, and all washed down with litres of soft drink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/2.mp3"},{"answer":"And with all the sugar in soft drink,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we can say you're definitely overindulging, don't you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I know, I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I intend to definitely stop drinking that from now on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/6.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's part of the sensible eating plan that we have agreed we need to formulate -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/7.mp3"},{"answer":"one that we can both follow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/8.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, sensible, and practical -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/9.mp3"},{"answer":"allowing us to indulge in some sweet foods on occasions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/10.mp3"},{"answer":"On rare occasions,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and we're going to cut out all the pizzas and hamburgers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, not totally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought you said pizzas could be eaten once a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/14.mp3"},{"answer":"You know how I like pizzas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/15.mp3"},{"answer":"No. I said once every two months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Once a week was ice cream, not pizza.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's because you like ice cream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I prefer pizza.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Peter, if you want to lose weight, you need to be disciplined,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/20.mp3"},{"answer":"in both what you eat, and what you do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/21.mp3"},{"answer":"which brings us to the issue of exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/22.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/23.mp3"},{"answer":"So, jogging twice a week, and hiking on Saturdays, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/24.mp3"},{"answer":"No, hiking is Sundays,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/25.mp3"},{"answer":"allowing Saturdays for the light walking exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I've investigated, and discovered there are a lot of walking trails around this suburb,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/27.mp3"},{"answer":"with many beautiful places if you just look around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/28.mp3"},{"answer":"So what's happening this Saturday?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/29.mp3"},{"answer":"A walk around the city?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/30.mp3"},{"answer":"That's later in the month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/31.mp3"},{"answer":"This Saturday we'll visit Pine Park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Hill Park is nicer, with great views, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but we have to travel too far to reach Hill Park,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so I ruled that out, and I love the smell of pines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And what about the weekday meals?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Salads every night, I suppose?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/37.mp3"},{"answer":"No, it's important to vary the meals so that the food remains interesting and fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The only common factor is the fruit juice,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/39.mp3"},{"answer":"but otherwise we'll have a variety of healthy fare,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/40.mp3"},{"answer":"from salads, to fish, to lean meat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd rather have meat every night, but you're the boss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/42.mp3"},{"answer":"If you want to lose weight, you'll have to accept this program, okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Now Mary, you said we could have a little treat in our diet plan three times a week:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/45.mp3"},{"answer":"specifically, Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Sundays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. A very small treat, but something to reward us for all the discipline shown.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Such rewards will motivate us to continue the diet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So, on Tuesdays, what can I choose?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/49.mp3"},{"answer":"You have a choice between a small serving of chocolate, ice cream, or biscuits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well, I'll go for the biscuits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I love those crunchy little things with my cup of tea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/52.mp3"},{"answer":"So do you, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I do indeed, so I'll have them, too, saving the ice cream for later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/54.mp3"},{"answer":"But I know how much you like ice cream,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/55.mp3"},{"answer":"so why don't you save it for the end of the week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/56.mp3"},{"answer":"That will give you the motivation to keep going,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can have chocolate midweek?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good idea,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/59.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think the most important thing is for you and I to eat different things on those other two days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you think that way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll eat the ice cream on Thursdays, not the chocolate. Okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, if you're having that, then I can't have ice cream.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/63.mp3"},{"answer":"In order to be different, I'll have the chocolate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/64.mp3"},{"answer":"So, we can compare our different snacks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and maybe even share a little with each other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly! And the variety and fun involved will take our minds of wanting more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Eating for fun! A good idea!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And then you can have the chocolate on Sunday, right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/69.mp3"},{"answer":"But I like biscuits?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I want biscuits again - to have with my cup of tea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/71.mp3"},{"answer":"But you have the biscuits on Monday, remember, and we can't repeat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah come on! This isn't fixed in concrete.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I can have them again instead of chocolate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/74.mp3"},{"answer":"You might like variety, but I don't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/75.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm a creature of habit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the whole point of this was to taste different snacks,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/77.mp3"},{"answer":"but if you want the same thing, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I, for one, am sticking to the original plan,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/79.mp3"},{"answer":"with ice cream to finish the week, and not another dose of chocolate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-29-2021-12-25-09-36-57/80.mp3"}]
